{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <datamodel><data id=\"code\" expr=\"'1'\"/></datamodel>\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <transition event=\"go\" cond=\"isReady()\" target=\"f\"/>\n    <transition event=\"eval\" cond=\"eval(code)\" target=\"f\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"f\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/lint019-undecidable-side-effects.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":2},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/lint019-undecidable-side-effects.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":43,"endLine":4,"startColumn":34,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"cannot prove that `cond` on `<transition>` has no side effect\n\n**Note:** conditional expressions in conformant documents \"SHOULD NOT have side effects\" (SCXML 1.0 §5.9.1); the validator could not decide this condition\n\n**Help:** declare the functions it calls in an inline `<script>`, or compute the value in executable content and read the result here\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 Appendix B Data Models\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9.1 Conditional Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §B.2 The ECMAScript Data Model","text":"cannot prove that `cond` on `<transition>` has no side effect"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":210,"start":201},"category":"lint"},"ruleId":"LINT019"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/lint019-undecidable-side-effects.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":46,"endLine":5,"startColumn":36,"startLine":5}}}],"message":{"markdown":"cannot prove that `cond` on `<transition>` has no side effect\n\n**Note:** conditional expressions in conformant documents \"SHOULD NOT have side effects\" (SCXML 1.0 §5.9.1); the validator could not decide this condition\n\n**Help:** declare the functions it calls in an inline `<script>`, or compute the value in executable content and read the result here\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 Appendix B Data Models\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.9.1 Conditional Expressions\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §B.2 The ECMAScript Data Model","text":"cannot prove that `cond` on `<transition>` has no side effect"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":270,"start":260},"category":"lint"},"ruleId":"LINT019"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`<log>` values must have no side effects (SCXML 1.0 §4.7.3) and conditional expressions in conformant documents should have none (§5.9.1), and the validator decides that statically: it follows document functions declared in inline `<script>` elements or `<data expr>`, but it cannot see a function it has no source for, text run as code (`eval`, `Function`), a `with` scope, a `<script src>`, a getter or conversion method with a side effect, or a write through a reference it cannot trace"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: declare the functions the expression calls in an inline `<script>`, or compute the value in executable content and read the result in the expression.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 Appendix B Data Models\n\nRun `scx --explain LINT019` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#profiles","id":"LINT019","name":"LINT019","properties":{"category":"lint"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the validator cannot prove a condition or `<log expr>` has no side effect"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}